Bundled pc_error executable
===========================

The bundled Linux x86_64 executable reports version 0.13.4 and is copied
unchanged from the original PointTC research project. Its exact source
commit and build provenance were not recorded. It is third-party software
and is not covered by PointTC's MIT license.

The following notices are reproduced from the public MPEG PCC distortion
metric source repository:
https://github.com/minhkstn/mpeg-pcc-dmetric
The currently published source identifies version 0.14.0; this reference
does not establish the exact source revision of the bundled executable.

Source: source/pcc_distortion.cpp
https://github.com/minhkstn/mpeg-pcc-dmetric/blob/master/source/pcc_distortion.cpp

